          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/082dae2fa1e345398585d17c63be348b_b04-te-recomiendo-que-destaques-tu-experiencia-con-clientes.mp3?Expires=1794099645&Signature=diPRG-dgbHNZP5N77kdE1mj209yRc8tSMV17Nspsq8rl0Je6aWXMWOeNUukFt8x8-Dznt-71RNWdMYebhsp0EZ4xP2k9SOBNSXen~~lRY3~eGWJMUBlXGJlZmEW9NO~-ZIB6WNReQ1UZr58D8VmCDf27-dTvgdkIVvSVQ5vhveyypYhYWjljm16P2TWkyhPM76lv1Z7wn37OVVhvqE2M5528-nG~dQf2LehrWhnaMW2v9artHoow8DIFWXvgOwQYXTPhuVyZD5Ywdv6Wl9S-iVzbGt~uAybfNVMlGYCpBtDmbYFrF4~pyrvNOL54K9YcNWkokF4U6WCk10YJfbAHRA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
