    {
      "id": "00dd76df-41c7-4141-b945-f7bdf16eb93d",
      "title": "Orientando uma candidatura",
      "description": "<p>Uma pessoa quer se candidatar. A outra orienta o ajuste do currículo e confirma que o perfil faz sentido para a vaga.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Me interesa la vacante, pero mi currículum todavía es muy general.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Tenho interesse na vaga, mas meu currículo ainda está genérico demais.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/485bf40f6dd1451888a69ce0a4f57ddf_b07-dlg-01-me-interesa-la-vacante.mp3?Expires=1794099645&Signature=pTQY5GFXAq3vnQjyxp2CVuqmpJB3pkfMNS9e0abYLpkoY9i1pcHqCNogFg0LuPgDPsKjp6fEyinFwkBLTffxkk9FMW7E9dRFOiyAOBUXo~FJ4ZMsL5M5Fy1Jo-pIZySvBv~FA128RqVJdhMcYVsPC7jhtMuT85ydsbeBKJU~Wu93wmBxfV4XePCsCvlpgBK4Y~kZ2uJOQlhI6eMnBjMDfwn9giBetAt3uCGkWYQ5m7NB2UhYOSpVxqAC~77~LAqVeaYNBW0BCEaE4tbN2ku7UeHMlMNyMfT5jODaksXTzoNsdClQuP9lZULJilxbpxS1n12-Lrgtqv69M7aj6yuFhg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Conviene que lo adaptes hoy al puesto.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Vale a pena adaptá-lo hoje para a vaga.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/df6f46ab485c44ac8639251def9d2869_b07-dlg-02-conviene-que-lo-adaptes.mp3?Expires=1794099645&Signature=Ebl3Jnc9cc9EVGBR3~PBmyQ1PZyRyLQ8xf-eR-xoxMx2m299wqHK1kRWnTF0CCX5dyn6CgnlFJvgn7D5duoq1tPcmkq07Qw3IIU01Pgs0~Jf-QOX~373cguNEINt3Xmpivfm6AmVG6zSdB0JQd-21-Y9~NeFlxZoDodwDbTPsKnUaJ0bok8T~5iLrybN9eM4q1UqcjdD7DZ-iibrs6hKEOT~3ZwO0OiNPayygCMZDLkaXzk-s1ZyCD9bLfWhOLcl-DN7eeBDzjNM-99ST4kv2QB54OMv8RFhD8quGnPljADYpj0j25F9Sq0H1Y8Xj4WmD9TR0oxGkmH7qPoKbGF0Mg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">De acuerdo. También puedo destacar mi experiencia con clientes.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Certo. Também posso destacar minha experiência com clientes.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/55d72e5af19748e2b97504dce9beeb74_b07-dlg-03-puedo-destacar-mi-experiencia.mp3?Expires=1794099645&Signature=Un3WWm7NPjzufaDL6QXAa4Vw9l7EKdam23sjFsUbzj7Kggaw0A-rESGTL4X3GRXQATAuAJbSIDe3bRes1P-UE8vHulpRfwxGolmIbRcOj1CXv26YjnWID35i3T6~7K12TveS~qu9CO1KIDRoSxyLIkRH3MC1qp-YdlDhUsnYxin-9rkUZA5tC6TmfI4r0BUwoM7ZFnvwTQCD7CZDG9r9fJgjWrhDLTCIl64FGSh1xja4G5ypxBTSve5gCrDmrKIfYYn7YMt1NVjg7qr91av6xmRXxfPF31YuyFU9JYsUh8GjCKiCwM5IvH2tq7s6FZ74KyTdkwMPv7oFyTcBOLY~VQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, te recomiendo que la destaques. Por tu perfil, encajas bien en este puesto.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, eu recomendo que você a destaque. Pelo seu perfil, você combina bem com esta vaga.</div>\n</div>",
